// Sort messages by timestamp before grouping. Realtime INSERTs append in
// arrival order, but PersonaPlex flushes its agent_text_buf on phrase
// boundaries (slightly delayed) while Scribe streams more eagerly — so
// a caller turn timestamped 0:16 can arrive AFTER an agent turn
